  "question": "What do the Vimose runes say?",
  "question_lang": null,
  "answer": "The Vimose inscriptions contain several runic texts, though their meanings remain partially uncertain. [S3] The inscriptions include \"harja,\" which is \"likely a personal name or 'comb'/'warrior'\"; \"mariha ... makija,\" which is \"possibly 'Mari (the famous one) is the sword of Alla'\"; and \"awgns,\" which is \"possibly 'son/descendant of Awa'.\" [S3] According to the source, \"Several inscriptions remain only partially deciphered.\" [S3]",
